        "created_at": "2015-01-18T22:14:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Another Captain Cosmic-related question: must a card take damage in order for it to have been dealt damage. &nbsp;For example:</p><p>Captain Cosmic has Cosmic Crest (\"Captain Cosmic and all Construct cards are immune to Energy Damage\") and Vitality Conduit (Construct; \"Play this card next to a Target. &nbsp;Whenever this card is dealt damage, That Target regains 2 HP.\") in play. &nbsp;Grand Warlord Voss plays Gene-Bound Ion-Lancer which deals 2 Energy Damage to Vitality Conduit. &nbsp;Vitality Conduit is immune to Energy Damage and takes no damage. &nbsp;Does Captain Cosmic get to heal 2 HP?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:26.179Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
