        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Another Captain Cosmic-related question: must a card take damage in order for it to have been dealt damage. &nbsp;For example:</p><p>Captain Cosmic has Cosmic Crest (&quot;Captain Cosmic and all Construct cards are immune to Energy Damage&quot;) and Vitality Conduit (Construct; &quot;Play this card next to a Target. &nbsp;Whenever this card is dealt damage, That Target regains 2 HP.&quot;) in play. &nbsp;Grand Warlord Voss plays Gene-Bound Ion-Lancer which deals 2 Energy Damage to Vitality Conduit. &nbsp;Vitality Conduit is immune to Energy Damage and takes no damage. &nbsp;Does Captain Cosmic get to heal 2 HP?</p>",
